WEBVTT

00:08.820 --> 00:15.580
In the deepest darkness lie the sleeping butterflies.

00:16.970 --> 00:23.520
Are they even aware of the blue sky?

00:25.130 --> 00:28.550
The world is fragile, like building blocks.

00:28.680 --> 00:32.530
I want a way to fly away.

00:32.890 --> 00:36.260
I pray for only one thing

00:36.740 --> 00:40.650
for the one that I love.

00:42.430 --> 00:46.380
Now, the dices were thrown.

00:46.440 --> 00:50.390
Paradise will rise in the future.

00:50.410 --> 00:54.580
You and I Tooi yumeni musubareru

00:50.410 --> 00:54.580
You and I will unite in this far away dream.

00:54.700 --> 00:58.430
And we will cross this red river.

00:58.490 --> 01:02.230
The flower embraces the cross with uncertainty.

01:02.490 --> 01:06.390
Like that, bloomed a fickle angel.

01:06.390 --> 01:10.460
We will one day find eternal love

01:10.710 --> 01:14.760
and I will give you Paradise.

01:33.770 --> 01:35.360
Strength of darkness...

01:35.570 --> 01:37.070
Strength of light...

01:42.270 --> 01:43.540
The evil stone...

01:43.540 --> 01:44.880
Dark Bring.

01:48.030 --> 01:49.560
The holy stone...

01:50.200 --> 01:50.890
Rave.

02:03.860 --> 02:07.090
The strange war caused by the
stones of darkness and light

02:07.360 --> 02:11.310
was supposed to come to an end on that day.

02:18.210 --> 02:22.250
This is going to be the last Dark Bring!

02:26.520 --> 02:27.940
Lets go, Plue!

02:27.950 --> 02:31.190
Release... The power of Rave!

03:05.520 --> 03:07.890
Alright, we did it, Plue.

03:08.220 --> 03:09.770
We finally...

03:10.040 --> 03:12.100
What are you doing? Legs go home.

03:12.660 --> 03:14.440
I don't ever want to see
a stone like that again.

03:15.170 --> 03:16.820
Finally, peace will...

03:27.810 --> 03:32.730
This massive explosion
destroyed 1/10 of the world.

03:33.000 --> 03:35.400
It was known around the world as Overdrive.

03:35.780 --> 03:38.030
After that, Dark Bring had hidden its existence...

03:38.030 --> 03:41.370
Rave also had disseminated
throughout the world.

03:41.790 --> 03:44.420
And now 50 years have passed.

03:52.000 --> 03:54.940
No matter what kind of
sacrifices I have to make...

03:55.440 --> 03:58.200
I must have Rave in my control.

04:32.690 --> 04:35.400
Red 23!

04:36.670 --> 04:38.580
Come on, come on! Red 23!

04:38.870 --> 04:40.630
Come, come this way.

04:40.660 --> 04:42.790
Where did that bastard run off to?

04:43.500 --> 04:46.180
Hey, Plue... Plue!

04:44.070 --> 04:46.180
Lets split up and search for him.

04:47.760 --> 04:49.180
Hey! Move!

05:02.890 --> 05:03.710
Did you see it!?

05:16.520 --> 05:18.160
What are you going do about this?!

05:19.250 --> 05:20.580
For once...

05:20.950 --> 05:23.500
I was about to reel in a big one!

05:26.300 --> 05:27.140
Hey son...

05:27.140 --> 05:30.940
Trying to play without paying the
entrance fee was not a wise decision.

05:31.320 --> 05:34.610
I only came in here to look for Plue, so...

05:34.940 --> 05:37.950
A lame excuse is still only a lame excuse.

05:38.160 --> 05:41.040
For not spitting out the money you
owe, you will experience some pain.

05:41.280 --> 05:42.390
Shit...

05:46.730 --> 05:48.560
Damn, that bastard!

05:53.460 --> 05:54.860
You saw it too, right!?

05:55.070 --> 05:57.990
That one definitely went into Red 23, right!?

05:58.350 --> 05:59.950
Hey, are you listening to me?!

06:09.180 --> 06:10.140
Jeez...

06:10.460 --> 06:11.900
It's all his fault!

06:17.970 --> 06:23.090
No matter what you people say, it definitely
went into Red 23!

06:32.460 --> 06:34.360
I feel better now.

06:35.770 --> 06:40.610
The one who inherits Rave

06:42.630 --> 06:44.170
I lost too much money.

06:48.420 --> 06:49.980
What kind of town is this anyway?

06:51.090 --> 06:53.020
Wait a minute.

06:53.060 --> 06:54.740
Where are you headed to, girl?

06:54.820 --> 06:56.990
What do you mean where?
I'm going out.

06:57.240 --> 07:01.000
Going out isn't going to be that simple.

07:01.650 --> 07:03.590
But that kind of choice is up to me!

07:03.970 --> 07:10.060
In this town, coming in is
free, but departing costs money.

07:11.060 --> 07:13.060
I've never heard of anything like this!

07:14.400 --> 07:17.660
Just pay what you have to
pay and we wont bother you.

07:18.410 --> 07:19.450
Or what?

07:19.750 --> 07:21.360
You want to go against us?

07:21.360 --> 07:23.340
Members of the Demon Card?

07:23.340 --> 07:26.180
Shit... This is the Demon Card's town.

07:29.720 --> 07:30.350
I should get out of here.

07:34.600 --> 07:36.150
One... two... three...

07:37.600 --> 07:39.910
Is this all that I have left?

07:40.190 --> 07:43.170
I guess I can't do anything
unless I win a big one.

07:53.640 --> 07:55.530
What... Are you?

07:57.530 --> 07:59.000
It's a bug!

07:59.050 --> 08:01.290
A b-bug? It's a bug?

08:01.290 --> 08:03.080
Hey you...

08:03.180 --> 08:05.470
How can you say that's... a bug?!

08:08.260 --> 08:09.930
Are you trying to say you're hungry?

08:12.310 --> 08:13.840
No way, no way! Not a chance!

08:13.890 --> 08:15.530
I won't treat you to anything.

08:15.670 --> 08:16.360
Later.

08:22.640 --> 08:24.420
Don't follow me!

08:24.990 --> 08:26.340
You are too stubborn.

08:26.470 --> 08:29.930
I am going gamble with all my money.

08:30.070 --> 08:32.230
I have no time to waste on you.

08:34.580 --> 08:37.450
Why are you trying to cling on me?!

08:38.830 --> 08:44.260
We are bad guys. Even crying
children will stop crying...

08:44.960 --> 08:47.890
We're Demon Card...

08:47.890 --> 08:50.210
Members.

08:51.850 --> 08:52.810
What?!

08:58.560 --> 08:59.950
I'm pissed now.

09:00.460 --> 09:02.290
If you don't disappear fast, I'll blast...

09:02.620 --> 09:05.300
So it understands?

09:08.910 --> 09:10.230
But it's a fool.

09:14.870 --> 09:16.040
Hey!

09:17.260 --> 09:19.620
Now look, you shouldn't eat
things without permission!

09:24.650 --> 09:26.180
What's up with today?

09:26.430 --> 09:27.680
Hey, lady...

09:28.900 --> 09:30.640
That dog, hand it over.

09:30.780 --> 09:31.900
D-dog?

09:33.680 --> 09:34.900
This is a bug.

09:34.950 --> 09:35.950
A bug!?

09:36.620 --> 09:37.390
Look!

09:38.230 --> 09:39.810
This girl, she's a fool.

09:40.290 --> 09:41.730
That's none of my business.

09:42.020 --> 09:43.740
That thing's legs have a big future...

09:43.950 --> 09:45.990
They should earn us a lot
money at the dog race.

09:45.990 --> 09:48.490
Come quietly!

09:49.030 --> 09:50.590
Why you little!

09:51.840 --> 09:52.760
It doesn't like it!

09:52.800 --> 09:55.470
I don't care whether it hates it or not!

09:55.600 --> 09:56.890
Look, lady!

09:56.970 --> 10:01.860
Do you know what happens when
you piss off Demon Card members?

10:02.190 --> 10:03.950
Well... I don't know.

10:04.610 --> 10:06.410
Don't make me laugh!

10:10.170 --> 10:11.380
You think we'll let you get away?

10:12.150 --> 10:14.340
I'm already pissed.

10:17.850 --> 10:19.770
But you're cute, so I'll treat you nicely.

10:22.260 --> 10:24.280
You can't even speak. Are you scared?

10:25.720 --> 10:26.560
Perverts.

10:47.550 --> 10:48.300
Out of my way!

10:48.900 --> 10:52.290
It seems like you guys didn't know what
happens when you piss me off, right?

10:52.440 --> 10:53.340
Bug...

10:56.060 --> 10:58.330
I wonder where it went...

11:01.520 --> 11:02.650
Dog Race Arena

11:03.380 --> 11:04.160
Brother...

11:04.790 --> 11:06.090
Goes there often.

11:06.090 --> 11:07.870
The dog... Betting...

11:09.040 --> 11:10.710
I see...

11:26.970 --> 11:31.070
Plue!

11:33.080 --> 11:34.420
Plue, that bastard...

11:34.810 --> 11:36.340
Where did it go?

11:41.490 --> 11:42.350
Well...

11:42.490 --> 11:44.860
If this was Garage Island, I
would've found him by now...

11:45.060 --> 11:46.840
But this city is big.

12:04.440 --> 12:05.610
Sister...

12:13.830 --> 12:15.590
<i>It's what you've all been waiting for...</i>

12:15.600 --> 12:17.930
<i>The main race of the day will start now!</i>

12:20.320 --> 12:22.600
<i>Number two, Yaotesuka, has a rocket start!</i>

12:22.800 --> 12:25.730
<i>Without that much difference in range, chasing
right behind him is number five, Pretty Holdbunz</i>

12:25.820 --> 12:27.570
<i>Oh! Just a moment!</i>

12:27.860 --> 12:29.580
<i>That one is way behind</i>

12:30.200 --> 12:32.460
<i>It has no hope at all because
it had a such a late start.</i>

12:32.600 --> 12:35.460
<i>It just made a u-turn towards the gate!</i>

12:35.750 --> 12:38.520
<i>And now, it's sitting down!</i>

12:38.530 --> 12:40.430
<i>This is really unbelievable!</i>

12:40.470 --> 12:42.350
<i>I can't believe this!</i>

12:44.720 --> 12:46.110
What the hell is it doing?!

12:46.920 --> 12:48.870
What happened to your legs!

12:48.960 --> 12:51.200
I have all my money riding on you!

12:51.360 --> 12:56.330
Number six. Alright, the
betting is 9999 times!

13:04.150 --> 13:05.780
W-What is he doing?!

13:12.520 --> 13:15.110
<i>Number six, Rocket Dash!</i>

13:15.140 --> 13:17.510
<i>It's fast, very fast!</i>

13:17.660 --> 13:19.390
Go!

13:27.150 --> 13:29.660
What the hell is that?!

13:32.450 --> 13:34.500
<i>It's the explosive zone!</i>

13:34.600 --> 13:37.300
<i>Well, no one knows what will
happen at Sudden Death!</i>

13:37.370 --> 13:39.930
<i>It's the beginning of Battle Road!</i>

13:45.970 --> 13:50.240
<i>Now, they are entering the Spear Zone!</i>

13:56.550 --> 13:57.260
Damn...

13:58.670 --> 14:00.470
<i>Those spears are raining down...</i>

14:04.610 --> 14:05.940
It might die...

14:06.990 --> 14:08.030
Doing things like this.

14:11.400 --> 14:13.000
This little bitch...

14:14.690 --> 14:17.840
How dare you mess up this race?

14:18.590 --> 14:19.850
This isn't even a race!

14:19.880 --> 14:21.100
Bullshit! Shut your mouth!

14:21.310 --> 14:24.900
I shall punish you along with that weird dog!

14:25.270 --> 14:27.090
It's not a dog! It's a bug!

14:27.140 --> 14:28.280
Shut up!

14:32.390 --> 14:34.340
Looks like you're out of bullets.

14:34.400 --> 14:35.380
Prepare yourself.

14:37.140 --> 14:38.720
Stop!

14:53.300 --> 14:54.590
Plue! Let's get out of here!

14:55.000 --> 14:56.340
Y-you're that!

14:56.670 --> 14:57.510
Weirdo!

14:57.600 --> 14:58.760
P-Panties!

15:08.950 --> 15:12.040
Hold these brats down!
No, never mind, kill them!

15:14.500 --> 15:16.470
Try if you can!

15:39.470 --> 15:41.180
Not bad!

15:44.250 --> 15:46.070
That's enough, kid!

15:57.480 --> 15:58.790
Demon Card!

16:00.130 --> 16:03.020
Don't think you'll be okay...

16:06.160 --> 16:08.280
Making the Demon Card your enemy.

16:08.400 --> 16:09.660
How convenient...

16:10.490 --> 16:13.560
I came from Garage Island,
to destroy you guys!

16:15.010 --> 16:18.220
This kid just doesn't know when to quit.

16:18.800 --> 16:21.560
You guys rule over the weaker ones by force...

16:22.020 --> 16:23.480
You guys... are the bad guys.

16:24.200 --> 16:26.900
That's what my sister said!

16:34.470 --> 16:35.760
I'm above you now.

16:45.730 --> 16:47.070
Dark Bring!

16:59.540 --> 17:02.390
Is that the power of Dark Bring?!

17:02.530 --> 17:04.610
Yeah. I can become smoke and...

17:05.010 --> 17:06.700
I can even do this.

17:09.140 --> 17:10.410
CO Heaven!

17:11.770 --> 17:13.210
I can't breathe.

17:13.300 --> 17:14.380
Painful, isn't it?

17:17.020 --> 17:19.350
This is Carbon Monoxide smoke.

17:20.030 --> 17:21.310
If you keep breathing it...

17:21.540 --> 17:23.770
You can go to heaven.

17:24.320 --> 17:26.400
It's all of sudden, but let me explain.

17:26.620 --> 17:29.870
Carbon Monoxide's chemical formula is CO.

17:30.000 --> 17:31.370
Yeah.

17:31.700 --> 17:34.670
If you keep breathing this this is what happens.

17:34.800 --> 17:36.920
Yeah...

17:37.390 --> 17:40.220
In another words, you rise to heaven...

17:40.350 --> 17:42.100
Tengoku in English is Heaven

17:42.200 --> 17:44.570
Which is why CO Heaven...

17:44.760 --> 17:47.360
Means "The Heaven of Carbon Monoxide".

17:47.700 --> 17:49.910
Yeah...

17:49.950 --> 17:51.160
Have a safe journey.

17:51.200 --> 17:52.830
I'm off...

18:03.640 --> 18:05.280
M-my attacks won't hit it?!

18:07.270 --> 18:08.370
It's no use.

18:08.470 --> 18:12.250
No matter what kind of attack it
is, it wont work on this smoke.

18:15.080 --> 18:18.220
You can't hold out, huh?

18:19.690 --> 18:22.020
If I don't do something now,
I'll be in serious trouble.

18:22.420 --> 18:23.860
That's right, the face.

18:24.570 --> 18:26.570
If my fist could only reach his face!

18:31.780 --> 18:32.870
Fool!

18:34.070 --> 18:35.880
Hitting his face is of no use as well...

18:40.880 --> 18:43.060
You have consumed a fairly
large amount of this smoke.

18:43.100 --> 18:45.280
You've passed the human limit.

18:45.400 --> 18:46.360
Slow!

18:47.070 --> 18:48.870
Why bother with useless struggles?

18:52.970 --> 18:56.680
Rave?!

19:04.380 --> 19:05.780
The smoke is...

19:10.800 --> 19:12.000
Are you alright?!

19:17.590 --> 19:18.760
How come you have Rave?

19:19.740 --> 19:21.470
It was given to me...

19:21.750 --> 19:23.230
By Shiba!

19:23.480 --> 19:24.900
Given?

19:25.090 --> 19:26.320
Then you are...

19:26.330 --> 19:27.780
You are...

19:27.940 --> 19:28.920
Lets go.

19:32.690 --> 19:35.120
The current inheritor of Rave!

19:44.810 --> 19:47.030
Explosion!

20:16.350 --> 20:17.680
Amazing!

20:19.530 --> 20:20.640
Lets go, Plue.

20:24.950 --> 20:25.860
Hey!

20:26.000 --> 20:27.530
Give me this bug!

20:27.540 --> 20:29.120
No! And that's not a bug!

20:37.400 --> 20:39.180
See? He's similar to dogs, right?

20:47.060 --> 20:48.370
Lets go, Plue!

20:58.220 --> 20:59.430
Stop!

20:59.900 --> 21:01.730
We can leave the town with this!

21:03.000 --> 21:04.070
I'm Haru.

21:04.260 --> 21:05.780
This is Plue.

21:05.820 --> 21:07.360
I'm Elie.

21:18.410 --> 21:20.100
Go guys!

21:20.100 --> 21:21.400
Go!

21:24.640 --> 21:26.760
Sh-Shuda...

21:26.870 --> 21:29.280
You're revealing how awful you are, Jouko.

21:30.220 --> 21:31.760
Please forgive me Shuda.

21:31.840 --> 21:32.620
Next time...

21:32.900 --> 21:34.710
There is no such thing as
next time in Demon Card.

21:34.800 --> 21:35.710
Please forgive...

21:36.090 --> 21:37.010
To think...

21:37.450 --> 21:39.470
He had Rave...

21:40.300 --> 21:45.520
S-Shuda.

21:54.370 --> 21:56.380
Most definitely it's the power of Rave...

21:57.580 --> 21:59.810
The one who uses Rave...

22:00.480 --> 22:02.770
Is he the inheritor of Rave?

22:13.620 --> 22:23.950
Under the moon, I became a chrysalis, kissed upon a glass sea of love.

22:23.950 --> 22:33.890
Your rhythm is like a wave, embraced by the words of its song.

22:33.890 --> 22:44.020
Live to feel me, my past disappears on the water's surface.

22:44.520 --> 22:54.630
Everything I believed in, I found with you, so...

22:54.630 --> 23:04.860
You're wings on my heart kono negai haruka na yume no shijima ni tokete

22:54.630 --> 23:04.860
You're the wings on my heart, this wish, a distant dream that melts on a deserted island.

23:04.860 --> 23:18.780
All I want is for the bluebird to lead me to you, and drift through the country.

23:19.060 --> 23:26.030
Toward the small sky that weeps.
